hive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990308479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990891457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107737#issuecomment-2990891457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107737","id":2990891457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yRWHB","user":{"login":"Infini-Creation","id":136735040,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCZpQA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136735040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation","html_url":"https://github.com/Infini-Creation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T10:38:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T09:38:32Z","body":"tested also with these releases:\nv4.5.dev4.official [209a446e3]\nv4.5.dev3.official [55fc6e73f]\nv4.5.dev2.official [af2c71397]\nsame result.\n\n06/22/2025 update:\nsame result with v4.5.beta1.official [46c495ca2]\n\n\nMRP added:\n[tml-nav-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20834976/tml-nav-issue.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990891457/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3035481317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107737#issuecomment-3035481317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107737","id":3035481317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc607cTl","user":{"login":"ohin","id":471272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/471272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T10:36:25Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T10:39:13Z","body":"It's not only that it is not visible. It does not even add the navigation region to the navigation server - in the other words: the navigation region defined with TileMap does not work!\n\nWe are on 4.4 and using navigation layer with our TileSets. When we tried our project on 4.5-beta2 we lost the navigation on tilemaps (the navigation layer on the tilesets is still visible).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3035481317/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036463770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107737#issuecomment-3036463770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107737","id":3036463770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60_MKa","user":{"login":"ohin","id":471272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/471272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T14:20:00Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T14:20:00Z","body":"Actually, the issue is maybe related to not being able to merge navigation regions -> it's hard to debug when the navigation region from tilemap can't be displayed.\n\nAnyway, we are not able to make navigation region merging work in 4.5 - neither between two NavigationRegion2D polygons nor between tilemap navigation region and NavigationRegion2D polygon. \n\nWe are happily using the merging in 4.4. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036463770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3110210583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107737#issuecomment-3110210583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107737","id":3110210583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65YgwX","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T21:22:23Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T21:22:23Z","body":"The MRP confirms that the TileMapLayer debug is broken. It is not that the navigation debug itself is broken but the TileMapLayer does not even call its own debug function. This is an already known issue by the TileMap devs.\n\n\n@ohin Please create a dedicated issue with your own MRP. It is highly likely that your issue does not relate to this issue here.\n\nThe MRP in this issue debunks the claim that the TileMapLayer navigation does not work in Godot 4.5.\n\nOpen the MRP, add a NavigationAgent2D or query the NavigationServer2D map and region state. both work just fine with the TileMapLayer.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3110210583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]